I'm very pleased to announce hledger 1.99.6 (2.0 preview release 6),
the last preview before hledger 2.0, due next month.
Built-in terminal/svg/html charts, --view, multi-report html,
amount expressions, CSV rules functions, holdings and roi improvements,
hledger-web power user features, twelve UI languages.
By using it, you'll help make 2.0 better!

